  "invariants": [
    "AgentSession Event append owns no core or session outbox",
    "BroadcastEventBus and UserEventSink are best-effort projection wakeups only",
    "business completion cannot depend on an in-memory broadcast being delivered",
    "reliable requests use typed commands and idempotent receipts",
    "reliable domain facts are written with an owning-domain transactional outbox",
    "consumers catch up with cursor, inbox and idempotency where reliability is required",
    "SessionEvent stores bounded invocation facts and never copies owning-domain aggregates",
    "uncertain Effects are never automatically retried by Host, replay or shadow"
